# playCaptureSound(Player player)
# Plays the "piece captured" sound for capture moves (flag=1
# ordinary capture, flag=3 en-passant capture). Non-capture moves
# play playMoveSound instead - applyMoveVisually picks one or the
# other based on the move's flag.
# CHANGE the sound name below.

@using rychess
@fast

@bypass /playsound minecraft:block.stone.break master @a[x=-9134.0,y=-61.0,z=9669.0,distance=..20] -9134.0 -61.0 9669.0 1 1
